# .gitignore
# spec_version: 0.1.0
# status: DRAFT
# phase: SPECIFICATION_BOOTSTRAP

# Repository hygiene rules for a specification-only bootstrap.
# [OBSERVED] This repository should contain Markdown specifications and a small
# set of supporting text files only.
# [OBSERVED] Production build artifacts are out of scope.
# [INFERRED] Editor and operating-system noise should be ignored to keep
# specification review clean and diff-friendly.
# [OBSERVED] No secrets should be stored in the repository.
# [OBSERVED] No generated runtime artifacts are expected in this phase.
# [SPECULATIVE] Additional ignore rules may be added later if contribution
# tooling introduces new local-only files.
# Related specs:
# - README.md
# - CONTRIBUTING.md
# - SECURITY.md
# - STATUS.md
# Review notes:
# - keep ignore rules minimal
# - avoid masking authored specification files
# - prefer explicit entries over broad wildcards
# - reassess if future tooling is introduced
# Ignored files and directories follow.
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.swp
*.swo
*~
.vscode/
.idea/
